    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a71cc7c54b3518fcdf08cfb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼、呼……\n训练员你也爆发了吗！？\n有跟涡轮一起燃烧吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8316d64bde5756ecd07fac326de91b6127cbb0b5c8a39826f61d01e69348553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f445ddbbe1d5ffc7b72801",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "双涡轮前所未有地全力投入训练中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b2804da4ed5549cea8e61002575d724510ba1e407374b95024c67a8bfb6e939",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dfe468f39889dd2b9c6837",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果要让“双涡轮流派的领头”\n完成究极进化──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1ae37fc97a1b717453a0f53aac6640ec51a0959efbfc8097dc51818e6218807",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:199eced18126d3c9ec1559b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身心有丝毫松懈是不可能的。\n若赛马娘与训练员没有完全\n合而为一的话也是不可能的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9521b6ae3cc5c7a5f2b4ae8021f8a68d60066f32aa0699a98cdb7215e7c381a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10d283875e5cbcedaa7e4be0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因为如此，\n双涡轮把自己逼到心肺即将爆炸──",
      "source_fingerprint": "97a88a2581f6475731c79c34a24429d38dfaab9580feee55fc3f577920713c7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066207.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39a7a2f957c74b12d2ce8701",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冲啊！从那里开始就是新境界了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3779852b6bc468c635cd855f43d7e99b2672c62f3abc8aa75553f350cc7efb54",
